<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">Nehemiah</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Nehemiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi sia in Hacaliah ii tapa Nehemiah ii a zawsa nasep teng tepteena ahi hi. Artaxerxes ii Persia kumpilian a sep a kum kul kum, Kislev tha in Susa khuapi ah keima Nehemiah ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka suapui khat ahi, Hanani sia midang pawlkhat taw Judah pan hong theng a, amate tungah Jerusalem khuapi thu le Babylon saltanna pan a cia kik Jew mipuite thu ka dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in, kei tungah a nungta lai teng a khua a tui a zot uh ciang haksatna lianpi a thuaknate le a kiim a paam a teang ngamdangmite ii a nomuna thu teng hong ko uh hi. Amate in Jerusalem luphungte a cimhtham in om lai a, kongpite a kihaltum pan kipan a kivawt kik ngawl laina thute zongh hong son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi thu teng ka zaak ciang to suk in ka kap hi. Ni tam mama khuangai in ka mau a an ka ne bua hi. Pathian tungah thu ka ngen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Vantung ah a mang Topa Pathian awng! Nang na lian a, nangma kiita in ka om uh hi. Nangma hong itte le na thupiak a zuite tungah na thuciamna thumaan takin na len hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa awng, hong en ta'n a, Israel mi na naseamte atu a sun a zanin ka thungetna hong ngai ta'n. Koma Israel mite mawna khialna teng hong pualaak khi hi. Ka taanghpupite le keima ka maw zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Seksol ngamtatna taw nang kong langpan zo uh a, nong thupiakte ka zui bua uh hi. Na naseampa Moses tungtawnin nong piak thukhamte ka zui bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma ii Moses tungah: ‘No Israel mite ka tungah nong thumaan bua uh le minam dangte sungah kong thethaang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahizong ka kungah hong zuan kikin kong thupiakte na zui uh le, leimong dongin kithethaang zo na hi uh hangin keima nong biak natu in ka tealsa munah kong paipui kik tu hi,’ na ci thute tu in phawk kik ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“ Topa awng, hite in nangma mi, na naseamte ahi uh hi. Na vaangletna le na thahatna taw amate na suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu in ka thungetna le nangma hong patoai nuam na naseam dangte theampo ii thungetnate hong ngai ta'n. Tuni in taangtutna hong pia ta'n a, kumpilianpa in hong hesuaksak ta'n.” Tua hun lai in keima in kumpilianpa sapittui a pia pa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tha li zawk ni khat ni in Artaxerxes kumpilianpa ii an a neak laitakin sapittui ka pia hi. Ama in nidang in ka hee maipuak hong mu ngeingawl ahiciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama in, “Banghangin hee tuak mama ni ziam? Na ci le na ngawl ahiciang na thin nop ngawlna om hi tu hi,” ci in hong dongh hi. Ka patau a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, na khansau tahen! Ka taanghpupite a kiphumna khuapi laltham a, a kongpite kaanghtum siatin a om laitak bangbangin khuangai ngawlin om thei tu khi ziam?,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpilianpa in, “Na dei sia bang ziam?” ci in hong dongh hi. Vantung Pathian tungah thu ka nget zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kumpilianpa tungah, “Kumpipa awng kei tungah nong lungkim a, kong ngetna nong pia nuam le ka taanghpupite kiphumna khuapi ka pua kik thei natu in Judah ngam ah hong paisak ta'n,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpilianpa in kumpiliannu taw tokhawm a, ka ngetna hong saang hi. Ama in bang tanvei ngei tu a, bang hun ciang hong heak kik tu ni ziam ci in hong dongh a, ka son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, nong hesuak zo le Judah ngam dong hong paisak thei natu in Euphrates Nitumna sang ngamukmangte tungah lai hong thaaksak ta'n, ci in ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpi thingtaamte a keam pa Asaph tungah Biakinnpi cinna kulh kongpite, khuapi luphungte le ka teen natu ka innthingte atu in thing hong piak natu zongh lai hong thaaksak natu ka ngen hi. Pathian in kei hong ompui ahikom ka nget theampo kumpilianpa in hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpilianpa in keima taw ngalkapbu pawlkhat le siphu ngalkap pawlkhat hong paisak a, Euphrates Nitumna ngam ah khual ka haw uh hi. Tualai ah kumpilianpa ii laithakte ngamukmangte tungah ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahizong Beth Horon khua pan Sanballat le Ammon ngamkhen pan ulian Tobiah in Israel mite ii phattuam natu in na a seam tu mihing khat hong pai ci thu a zaak uh ciang thin uuk mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem ah ka paisuak a, ni thum sung
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerusalem atu in ka nasep tu Pathian ii hong heaksak thute kuama tungah ka son bua hi. Tuaciang zankim laitakin tho in ka pusuak a, ka lawmte pawlkhat ka paipui hi. Keima tona laa sia ngawl buang nganhing dang ka keng bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zan lai ma in khuapi nusia in nitumna sang Kuam Kongpi tawnin thangsang Ngulpui Tuinaak kaantan in Ninthuk Kongpi ah ka pai hi. Ka pai kawmin khuapi luphung cimhthamte le mei ii kak kongpite ka en kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang khuapi nisuana sang pan saksang Tuinaak Kongpi le Kumpipa Tuili ah ka pai hi. Ka tona laa sia in suangkawm ah lampi mu zo ngawl ahikom,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kidron kuam ah ka tuaksuk a, laa tung to kawmin luphung ka en hi. Tuaciang ka paina lampi tawnin ka heak kik a, Kuam Kongpi kaantan in khuapi sungah ka tum kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualsung uliante khat zongh in ka omna mun ahibuale ka nasepte he ngawl hi. Jew ka mipuite — thiampite, lampuite, uliante, ahibuale nasepna ah hong kihel mihing khat pawpo tungah tu dong bangma ka son bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahizong tu in amate tungah, “Jerusalem lalcip in a kongpite kisusia ahikom ih ngim ngana teng en vun! Khuapi luphungte ciang kikin ih minsiatna teng bosak tawng,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang amate tungah Pathian ii kei hong ompuina a hong panpuina le kumpilianpa ii kei tungah hong ci teng ka son hi. Amate in, “Puua kik tu nasep kipan tawng!” hong ci kik hi. Tuaciang amate nasep kipan tu in kithoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sanballat, Tobiah le Arab mi Geshem in sep tu ka ngealna te a zaak uh ciang amate in hong nuisan a, “Bang teng sep sawm nu ziam, kumpilianpa langpan tu nu ziam?” hong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in, “Vantung Pathian in kote zawna hong pia tu hi. Kote ama naseamte hi a, nasep ka kipan tu uh hi. Ahizong note in Jerusalem ah neisa te taw kisai in thu na nei bua uh a, tuaciang a taanghthute sungah no kihelna uh om ngawl hi,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khuapi ii luphung sia hi bangin kiciang kik hi. Thiampi Lianbel Eliashib le a thiampipuite in Tuu Kongpi vawt kik a, aapin, tuaciang kongpite a omna mun tek ah koi uh hi. Amate in luphung sia Zakhat Tausaang le Hananel Tausaang dongin aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jericho mite in tua luphung cian a khen zom sia ciang uh hi. Imri ii tapa Zaccur in a khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hassenaah ii bee le phung in Ngasa Kongpi vawt hi. Amate in a zawlte thung a kongpite bulh in, kongpi kha natu in a kalhnate le a zawlte thua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Uriah ii tapa, Hakkoz ii tupa ahi Meremoth in a khen zom sia, ciang hi. Berechiah ii tapa, Meshezabel ii tupa ahi Meshullam in a khen zom sia, ciang hi. Baana ii tapa Zadok in a khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tekoa mite in a khen zom sia ciang ahihang, khua sung lampuite in nasep ukte ii amate sep tu a, a see nasepte nial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Paseah ii tapa Joiada le Besodeiah ii tapa Meshullam te in Jeshanah Kongpi vawt kik uh hi. Amate in a zawlte thung a kongpite bulh in, kongpi kha natu in a kalh nate le a zawlte thua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gibeon pan Melatiah, Meronoth pan Jadon, tuaciang Gibeon le Mizpah mite in Euphrates Nitumna ngamukmangpa inn dong a khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khamh seakpa Harhaiah tapa Uzziel in a khen zom sia, ciang hi. Paaknamtui vawt pa Hananiah in Luphung Zai ciang dong a khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem khenlang a ukpa Hur ii tapa Rephaiah in a khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Harumaph ii tapa Jedaiah in ama inn kung a khen zom sia, ciang hi. Hashabneiah ii tapa Hattush in a khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Harim ii tapa Malchijah le Pahath Moab ii tapa Hasshub in a khen sia zom sia ciang in Meikhukte Tausaang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerusalem khenlang a ukpa Hallohesh ii tapa Shallum in a khen zom sia, ciang hi. (A tanute in nasep hu uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hanun le Zanoah khuapi a, a teangte in Kuam Kongpi vawt kik uh hi. Amate in kongpite a omna munah koi in, kongpite kha natu in a kalhnate le a zawlte bulh a tua luphung sia metre 440 sung Ninthuk Kongpi dong puua kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Beth Haccherem ngamkhenno ukpa Rechab ii tapa Machijah in Ninthuk Kongpi vawt kik hi. Ama in kongpite a omna munah koi a, kongpi kha natu in a kalhnate le a zawlte bulh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mizpah ngamkhenno ukpa Colhozeh ii tapa Shallum in Tuinaak Kongpi vawt kik hi. Ama in kongpi tuamin kongpite a omna munah koi in, a kalhnate le a zawlte bulh hi. Ama in kumpi huan ii zom, Shelah Tuili ah a om luphung sia David Khuapi pan tuaksukna keallei dong ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bethzur Ngamkhenno ii lang a ukpa Azbuk ii tapa Nehemiah in a khen zom luphung sia David ii thaan, tuili le ngalkap innte dongin ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A nuai a, Levi te in luphung a khen zom tam mama te ciang kik uh hi: Bani ii tapa Rehum in a khen zom sia ciang hi; Hashabiah, Keilah Ngamkhenno lang ukpa in a ngamkhenno sia taangin a khen zom sia, ciang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Henadad ii tapa Bavvai, Keilah Ngamkhenno ii lang, a taanglai teng a ukpa in a khen zom sia, ciang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jeshua ii tapa Ezer, Mizpah ngamukpa in ngalhiamte koina mai, luphung a koaina mun dong a khen zom sia, ciang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zabbai ii tapa Baruch in Thiampi Lianbel Eliashib inn kongbiang dong a khen zom sia, ciang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Uriah ii tapa, Hakkoz ii tupa ahi Meremoth in Eliashib inn mong dong a khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nuai a, thiampite in luphung khen tam mama te ciang kik uh hi: Jerusalem kiim a teang thiampite in a khen zom sia, ciang uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Benjamin le Hasshub in amate inn mai ah a khen zom sia, ciang uh hi. Maaseiah ii tapa, Ananiah ii tupa ahi Azariah in a inn mai a khen zom sia, ciang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Henadad ii tapa Binnui in Azariah inn pan luphung king dong a khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uzai ii tapa Palal in a cingte zum paam kumpi inn tungnung tausaang le luphung ii king pan kipan a khen zom sia, ciang hi; Parosh ii tapa Pedaiah in nisuana sang Tui Kongpi nai le Biakinnpi cinna tausaang kung dong a khen zom sia, ciang hi. (Hi mun sia Ophel kici khuapi taw a kinaina mun hi a, biakinn naseamte teenna hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tekoa khua mite in Biakinnpi cinna tausaang lian ii langkhat mun khat pan Ophel nai luphung dong a khen zom sia a nii veina in ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thiampi pawlkhat in Siphu Kongpi pan saksang zuan in amate inn mai tek ah a khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Immer ii tapa Zadok in ama inn mai ah a khen zom sia, ciang hi. Shecaniah ii tapa Shemaiah, Nisuana Kongpi keampa in khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Shelemiah ii tapa Hananiah le Zalaph ii tapa lukna Hanun in a khen zom sia a nii veina in ciang hi. Berechiah ii tapa Meshullam in a inn mai ah a khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khamh seakpa Malchijah in nisuana saksang luphung king tung belh ah om inndoi naina, Miphkad Kongpi kung, biakinn naseamte le sumzuakte zak inn dong a khen zom sia, ciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khamh seakte le sumzuakte in a king a om inndoi sia pan Tuu Kongpi dong a khen khakbel luphung sia, ciang uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Koma Jew te in luphung cian ka kipat kikna thu Sanballat in a zaak ciang a thin uukin, hong selno hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lawmte le Samaria ngalkapte mai ah ama in, “Hi a huathuai Jew te in bang teng vawt kisa ziam? Khuapi puua kik nuam ziam? Sangaw biakpiaknate piakna taw ni khat sungin nasep zo thei tu in kingaisun ziam? Uksuang tawng kaanghmong teng taw inn sak natu suang vawt thei tu ki um ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama kung a ding Tobiah in, “Amate in bang luphung nam ciang thei ngei tu ziam? Ngia khat ngawngawn in tuasia phulvawk zo tu hi!” ci thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in thu ka ngen a, “Pathian awng, ko hong selnonate za in! Hong selnonate amate lu tungah tu tahen. A neisa theampo kisuttol tahen a, ngamdang ah thongtaak tu in kipaipui tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tatsiatnate maisak heak in a, a mawnate mangil heak in, banghang ziam cile amate in ko inn sate hong zawngsak uh hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabangin kote in luphung ciang tawto in, mite naseam thanuam ahikom, hai ngawlin a saanna bup ii lang kizo to paih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem luphung cian kik a kingaih mama na thu le luphung hawngvangte a kihukna thute Sanballat, Tobiah le Arabia mite, Ammon mite le Ashdod mite in a zaak uh ciang a thin uuk mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, amate kipawlin Jerusalem simin buaisak sawm uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ahizong ih Pathian tungah thungen in, sun le zanin ngalvil tu mihing ka koi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang amate in Judah mite ii a nei la khat sia sa uh hi: “Eite vanhngit pua in nasep ngimin ih tha kiam a; Uksuang tawng tua tu tam mama hi. Tuni in bangbang luphung ciang zo tu hi ziam?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ih ngalte in, eite ii ih mu ma in ahibuale a piang teng ih heak ma in ei kung hong thengin hong thatlum tu a, tuabangin nasep hong tawlngasak tu hi, ci in ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang ih ngalte sungah a teang Jew te in ei hong sawm ih ngalte ngealna teng ih kidop thei natu in a hun, a hun in hong ko uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka mite namsau, tei le thal te ka pia a, a kiman ngawl lai mun teng pan ngal pang tu in luphung nungsangah a bee le a phung zui in ka omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mite thinngimna ka mu ciang amate tung, a lampuite tung le uliante tungah, “Ih ngalte kiita heak vun. Topa bangza lian a bangza kiitakhuai ci sia phawk vun a, na ngammipuite atu, na tate atu, na zite atu le na bangkuate atu in ngalsim tavun,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ih ngalte hong sawmna thute ih heak hunlam sia za in, amate ngealnate Pathian ii a lalsak hunlam tel uh hi. Tuaciang luphung cianna ah ka vekpi in ka kuan kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hun a kipanin ka mite a lang in naseam a, a lang sia ngal simna puante silhin, tei, lum le thal te toai in ngalvil uh hi. Tuaciang ih lampuite in luphung a ciang mite nasia takin panpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vanhzak a nawn mite ngawngawn in a khut langkhat taw naseam in a langkhat ah ngalhiam toai uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />naseam peuma in a kawngah namsau khat tek kua hi. Patauna lemle tum tu pa sia keima taw omkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima in mipite, a uliante le lampuite tungah, “Ih nasepna zai a, kikhuala in luphung tungah khat le khat ih kikhenthaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lemle aw na za uh le ka kiim ah hong kikhawm tavun. Ih Pathian in ei atu ngal hong simsak tu hi,” ci in ka son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabangin, ni simin zing khuavak pan zan aksite a sua dong ko teng a lang in luphung ka cian uh laitak a lang sia tei toai in ngalvilin om khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua hun sungin nasep ukte tungah amate le nasep a hute theampo sia zanin khuapi ih cin thei natu le sun zongh in na ih sep thei natu in Jerusalem ah zantaam tu in ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima, ka lawmte, ka naseamte le keima hong cingte in zan ngawngawn in ka puante ka suut bua uh hi. Tuaciang ka ngalhiam tek ka toai siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tawmvei zawkciang nupi le pasal, mi tam mama in Judah a mipuite tungah lungkim ngawlin a phun uh kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawlkhat in, “Ko innkuan liante in nuntak natu antang ka kisamh uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A dangte in, “Pukthi ngawl natu in, antang a khom a nga natu ka lote, ka sapithuante le ka innte ka pong uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A dangte in, “Koma lote le sapithuante tungtaang phiangshia piak tu in sum ka puk uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ih Judah mipuite taw minam kibang khu hi. Ka tate amate tate taw kibangin pha hi ngawl ziam? Ahizong ka tate sila ka suasak kul hi. Ka tanute pawlkhat sila in kizuak zo hi. Ko cimaw khu hi, banghang ziam cile koma ii lote le sapithuante hong kilaaksak zo hi,” ci lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A phunnate ka zaak ciang ka thin uuk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka ngamtat tu ka khensat hi. Mipi lampuite le a uliante ka pau a, “Na suapuite nengcip nu hi!” ka ci hi. Tua buaina taw kisai in mihonpite ka sam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />amate tungah, “Ngamdangte tungah amate le amate a kizuak ih Judah mealheakte sia ih hi theiza in ih tan kik hi. Tu in Judah a mipuite ahi note tungah amate le amate hong kizuak natu in na mealheakte zawthawk vawt nu hi!” ka ci hi. A lampuite thim dide in om a, bangma son thei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang keima in, “Na ngamtatna uh khial nu hi! Pathian ii thu ni in, a maan bang na sep kul hi. Tua hile ih ngalte ahi Gentile te in ei hong selno natu thu om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipite in keima tung pan sum le antang ka pusak hi, ka lawmte le ka na a seamte zongh tuabang ma in sum le antang keima tung pan ka pusak hi. Tu in leibate ih not nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No tungah amate hong bat — dangka, antang, sapittui ahibuale olive thau teng theampo maisak siat tavun. A lote, a sapithuante, a olive huante le a innte thakhat ma in amate pia kik paih vun!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lampuite in, “Na ci bangin ka vawt tu uh hi. A neisate ka pia kik tu uh a, leibate zongh ka siik buatu uh hi,” ci in zo kik hi. Thiampite ka sam a, lampuite ii tu mama a, ka kamciam sia a zui natu in, thiampite mai ah lampuite ka kiciamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ka kawngsawmna dial suutin ka thing hi. Keima in, “Na kamciam bang a zui ngawl peuma Pathian in hi bangin hong thing tu a, Pathian in na innte le na neisa theampo la in, bangma hong nusiat ngawl tu hi,” ka ci hi. Tualai ah a omte theampo in, “Amen!” ci in Topa pok uh hi. Tuaciang lampuite in a kamciam len uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Artaxerxes ii kumpilian a sep zawk kum kulna pan kipan kum 32 dong, kum sawm le kum nii sung theampo Judah ngam uk ka sep sungin ngamukmang khat ka hina taw ka nga an sia keima le ka mealheakte in ka ne bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mai ah ngamukmang a seam peuma mipite ii vanhngit hi a, ni simin a an tu le a sapittui tu in ngunn dangkatang 40 veu ngen uh hi. A naseamte ngawngawn in mipite nengcip hi. Ahizong keima in Pathian zakta ka hikom tuabangin ka ngamta bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka tha ka ngal teng luphung cian kikna ah ka zangh a, keima atu in vanh bangma ka la bua hi. Keima atu na a seam pawpo luphung cianna ah kihel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kiim le paam ngam pan ka kungah hong pai mi theampo dom ngawlin, ka an neakna sabuai ah Judah te le a lampuite 150 hunmaanin an ka vaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni simin a neak tu khuital khat, tuu limcibel luk, le ak tam mama ka pia a, ni sawm simin sapittui thak ka pia hi. Ahihang mihonpite ii haksatna he ka hikom, ngamukmangpa ii nga tu hamphatnate ka la bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian awng, nang tungah thu kong ngen hi, hi mipite atu in ka septe theampo, keima noptuam natu in hong tepteesak ta'n.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kongpi lam ah kongpite bulh ngawl lai ka hi uh hang, luphung cian ka man zawkna uh thu le a hawngvang mun a om nawn ngawlna thu Sanballat, Tobiah, Geshem le ka ngal dangte in za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang Sanballat le Geshem in Ono Zaangtam khuanote khat ah amate taw kimu nuamin kam hong vaitha hi. Hisia sia keima bang khat po hong law nop manin hong theamna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate kungah kamtaite ka paisak a, “Nasep thupi ka vawt laitak hi in tualai ah paisuk thei ngawl khi hi. Noma taw kimu natu bekin nasep tawlngasakin kong pai buatu hi,” ka cisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in tuabangin livei kam hong vaitha a, tua hun simin tuabang veu ma in ka zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciang a nga veina ah Sanballat in tazeik tup ngawl laithak khat, a naseamte khat in hong piasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua lai sungah: “Geshem in kei tung hong son a, nangma le Jew mite in ngaltho nuam ahi hu in, luphungte ciang kik hi, ci in kiim le paam mite sungah kison kheukho hi. Tuaciang nangma le nangma kumpi na kisuasak natu in ngeal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaciang nangma Judah kumpi na hina thu, kamsaang pawlkhat in Jerusalem khua sungah a thansak natu in ngealna nei hi, ama in hong ci si hi. Kumpipa in hi thu, za nanak tu ahikom keima taw kimu in thuson khop tu ka ngaisun hi,” ci in ki at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama tungah lai ka thuk kik a: “Na ci teng a maan om ngawl hi. Nangma phua tawm vive hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nasep tawlngak thei natu in amate in ko hong lauthawn hi. Thu ka ngen a, “Ahizong tu in Pathian awng, hong thahatsak ta'n!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi hun sung khawngin a inn a nusia thei ngawl, Delaiah ii tapa, Mehetabel ii tupa Shemaiah kungah haw tu in ka pai hi. Ama in kei tungah, “Nangma le keima, Biakinnpi sung Thiangtho Mun ah pai in ih buu khawm tu a, kongkhate ih kalh tu hi, banghang ziam cile nangma that tu in amate hong pai tu hi. Tu in nangma that tu in zan khat pawpo amate hong pai tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima in, “Kei sia tai in, a buu thei nam ka hi bua hi. Biakinnpi sung bukna taw ka nuntakna huuk sawm tu in hong ngaisun ni ziam? Tuabangin ka buu buatu hi,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ngaisut kik ciang Pathian in Shemaiah tungah thu son ngawl ahihang, hi kidop natu thu kei hong son tu in Tobiah le Sanballat in ama sumnguk pia a hina thu ka phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in ka min hong siatsak natu le maizum ka nga natu in mawna sung ka tum dongin hong lausak tu in Shemaiah cial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thu ka ngen a, “Pathian awng, Tobiah le Sanballat ii ngamtatna phawk in a, amate daan pia in. Kei hong lausak nuam tua numei nu Nodiah le a dang kamsaangte theampo phawk in,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni 52 a kisep zawkciang Elul tha ni 25 ni in luphung bup kiman thiang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngam kiim tengah a om ih ngalte in hi thu a zaak uh ciangin, Pathian huna taw nasep a kizawna thu a kuama po in he ahiciang, amate atu maizumhuai ahi hunlam phawk tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi hun sung theampo Judah lampuite Tobiah taw lai kithaak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tobiah ii sunghpa sia Jew mi Arah ii tapa Shecaniah a hi hu in Judah ngamsung mi tam mama ama sangah pang uh hi. Tua banah a tapa Jehohanan in Berechiah ii tapa Meshullam ii tanu teenpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mite in ka mai ah Tobiah ii na pha a sep theampo son in, ka ci theampo zongh ama tungah son siat uh hi. Tuaciang ama in kei lau natu hanciam a, lai hong thaak tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in luphung cian kik kiman zo a, kongpite kibul siatin biakinn cingte, a thiangtho biakna lasa pawlte le a dang Levi te a nasep tek kihawmsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khuapi a uk tu in mihing nii ka koi a, ka suapuipa Hanani le kulhpi a uk ngalkapmangpa Hananiah ahi hi. Hananiah sia a muanhuai le Pathian a kiita khat hi a, kuama taw kibang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate tungah, Jerusalem kongpite zingsang nisua zawk mateng a kihon ngawl natu le nitum ciang kongcingte a cia ma in kongpi a kha natu in ka sawl hi. Amate tungah Jerusalem ah a teang mite sung pan khuapi cingte panmun pia a, pawlkhat sia a kisamh na munte ah, a dangte sia amate innhuang tek a cing tu in a koi natu zongh ka vaitha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem sia khuapi lian khat hi napi a sungah mihing tam teang ngawl a, inn tam kisa ngawl lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mipite, a lampuite le a uliante kaikhawm tu le, a innkuan sung mihing tepteena lai sit tu in Pathian in ka thin hong thawn hi. Saltanna pan hong cia masabelte tepteenate ka mu a, a nuai a bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saltaang tam mamate in Babylon ngam nusia in amate khuapi tek ahi, Jerusalem le Judah ah ciakik uh hi. A innkuanpuite sia Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa ii amate thongtaak tu a, a paipui pan kipan Babylon ah saltaangin teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lampuite sia Zerubbabel, Joshua, Nehemiah, Azariah, Raamiah, Nahamani, Mordecai, Bilshan, Mispereth, Bigvai, Nehum le Baanah ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saltanna pan a cia kik Israel bee le phungte sung pan mihing phaza tek sia hi bang ahi hi: Parosh — 2,172 Shephatiah — 372 Arah — 652 Pahath Moab (Jeshua le Joab suan le paalte) — 2,818 Elam — 1,254 Zattu — 845 Zaccai — 760 Binnui — 648 Bebai — 628 Azgad — 2,322 Adonikam — 667 Bigvai — 2,067 Adin — 655 Ater (Hezekiah zongh kici) — 98 Hashum — 328 Bezai — 324 Hariph — 112 Gibeon — 95
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A taanghpupite teenna a nuai a khuate pan mite zong ciakik hi: Bethlehem le Netophah — 188 Anathoth — 128 Beth Azmaveth — 42 Kiriath Jearim, Chephirah le Beeroth — 743 Ramah le Geba — 621 Michmash — 122 Bethel le Ai — 123 A dang Nebo — 52 A dang Elam — 1,254 Harim — 320 Jericho — 345 Lod, Hadid le Ono — 721 Senaah — 3,930
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Saltanna pan a cia kik thiampi bee le phungte tepteena lai hi bang ahi hi: Jedaiah (Jeshua suan le paalte) — 973 Immer — 1,052 Pashhur — 1,247 Harim — 1,017
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Saltanna pan a cia kik Levi bee le phung teng: Jeshua le Kadmiel (Hodaviah ii suan le paalte) — 74 Biakinn music thiamte (Asaph ii suan le paalte) — 148 Biakinn cingte (Shallum, Ater, Talmon, Akkub, Hatita le Shobai ii suan le paalte) — 138
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Saltanna pan a cia kik Biakinn naseamte ii bee le phung teng: Ziha, Hasupha, Tabbaoth, Keros, Sia, Padon, Lebana, Hagaba, Shalmai, Hanan, Giddel, Gahar, Reaiah, Rezin, Nekoda, Gazzam, Uzza, Paseah, Besai, Meunim, Nephushesim, Bakbuk, Hakupha, Harhur, Bazlith, Mehida, Harsha, Barkos, Sisera, Temah, Neziah le Hatipha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Saltanna pan a ciakik Solomon naseamte ii bee le phung teng: Sotai, Sophereth, Perida, Jaalah, Darkon, Giddel, Shephatiah, Hattil, Pochereth Hazzebaim le Amon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Saltanna pan a ciakik biakinn naseamte ii suan le paalte le Solomon ii naseamte ii suan le paalte a vekpi in 392 pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Delaiah, Tobiah le Nekoda bee le phungte pan 642 om a, Tel Melah, Tel Harsha, Cherub, Addon le Immer khua pan a ciakikte hi; ahihang amate in Israel suan le paal te a hina lak thei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />A taanghpupite ii khangngui tepteena lai a lak tu a mu zo ngawl thiampi bee le phungte sia a nuai a teng hi: Hobaiah, Hakkoz le Barzillai te hi. (Barzillai thiampi bee le phung ii taanghpupi in Gilead mi Barzillai bee le phung numei khat teenpui a, a sunghpa min la ahikom Barzillai bee le phung kici hi.) A taanghpupite pianna lak thei ngawl ahikom amate thiampi in kisaang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Judah ngamukmangpa in Urim le Thummim a zangh thei thiampi khat a om mateng in Pathian tungah a kipia ante, ne thei ngawl tu nu hi, ci in amate son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />saltanna pan a ciate a vekpi in — 42,360 A naseamte pa le numei — 7,337 Music thiam pa le numei — 245 Siphu — 736 Laa — 245 kalaoh — 435 Laano — 6,720 pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Mihing tam mama in Biakinnpi sakkik natu in na manphate a nuai a bangin pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Thiampite, Levi te, biakinn cingte, music thiamte, mi nautaang tam mamate, biakinn naseamte - Israel mite theampo — Judah ngamsung khuate le khuapi te ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tha sali tha in Israel mite theampo a khua tek ah teang thei hi. Tua tha ni khat ni in amate theampo Jerusalem Tui Kongpi sungsang leitual ah kikhawm uh hi. Amate in Topa ii Moses tungtawn a, Israel a piak Thukham laibu a la tu in thiampipa, Thukham he mipil Ezra sawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Ezra in mipite ahi — pasal, numei le thutel thei sa patangte kikhopna munah tua laibu paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualai kongpi hui leitual ah ama in Thukham laibu sia zing khuavak pan nisun dong amate tungah simh in pha takpi in ngai tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hunsung thuson natu in a vawt thing dawtuam tungah Ezra ding hi. Ama ziatsang ah a ding teng: Mattithiah, Shema, Anaiah, Uriah, Hilkiah le Maaseiah; ama veisang ah a ding teng: Pedaiah, Mishael, Malchijah, Hashum, Hashbaddanah, Zechariah le Meshullam ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dawtuam saangna ah a ding Ezra sia, amate in mitsuan nginge uh hi. Ezra in laibu a hon po ciang amate ding siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ezra in, “A lian Pathian, Topa pok vun!” ci hi. Mihing theampo in a khutte laamto in, “Amen! Amen!” ci in zo uh hi. Mipite khupdin in a maitang lei a phak dong kunin bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate a omna tek ah ding to in, a nuai a Levi te: Jeshua, Bani, Sherebiah, Jamin, Akkub, Shabbethai, Hodiah, Maaseiah, Kelita, Azariah, Jozabad, Hanan le Pelaiah te in amate tungah thukham sonthiang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mipite ii a tel thei natu in amate in Pathian Thukham sia pheenin thiang son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipite in Thukham ii tangkalte a zaak uh ciang a thin suu in kap uh hi. Tua ahiciang ngamukmangpa Nehemiah, thiampi le Thukham he mipil Ezra le mipite tungah Thukham a thiangson Levi te in mite theampo tungah, “Tuni sia na Pathian, Topa atu in thiangtho ahikom, khuangai in a kap tu na hi bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu in cia tavun a, anlim tuilim neakna vawt tavun. Na an le na sapittuite, neak tu a kitaangsamhte hawm tavun. Tuni sia ih Topa atu in thiangtho ahikom hee heak vun. Topa ii hong piak lungdamna in note hong thahatsak tu hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi te in mipite dai khipkhepin om sak a, tubang ni thiangtho ni in a hee ngawl natu in son kawkoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate tungah a kisim thukhamte a telthiang hu in mipite a inn uh ah cia a, lungdam takin an le tui ne in, a nei pawpo ngualdangte hawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A zing ciang in bee le phung lutangte sia thiampite le Levi te taw Thukham hilnate sin tu in Ezra kungah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa ii Moses tungtawnin a piak Thukham in Israel mite thaampheang buk te sungah thinnuam takin a teen zii natu a sawlna thu, amate in mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in Jerusalem le a dang khuapite, khua theampo ah zui tu in a nuai a bangin thupia uh hi: “Thukham sungah zui tu in a ki at bangin mual tungah pai vun a, buk sak natu in taakthing baak, olive baak, myrtle baak, palm baakte le a dang thingbaakte la vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahiciang mipite in thingbaakte saat in amate innkhum tam tung, a leitual, biakinn suumsung le, Tui Kongpi le Ephraim Kongpi hui ah a om taangpi khawlmunte ah bukte sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kimat na pan a cia kik mite theampo in buk sa in tuate sungah teang uh hi. Hisia in Nun ii tapa Joshua hun zawkciang, a kivawt ciil hi a, a kuama po ii thin phawngin lungdam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in poai hunsung ni masa pan kipan ni tawp ni dong ni simin Pathian ii Thukham khen khat veu sim uh hi. Amate in ni sali sung poaikhaam in, Thukham ii deina bangin ni liat ni in poai khupna vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua tha ni 24 ni in, a mawnate hangin khuangaina lakna in antang tu in Israel mite kikhawm uh hi. Amate sia ngamdangmite theampo taw kikhen zo uh hi. Amate in a khuangai lakna in khau-ip puan silhin a lu tungah leivui poai uh hi. Tua zawkciang dingin amate le a taanghpupite mawnate a pualaak tu kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nai thum sung Topa a Pathian ii Thukham teng amate tungah kisim a, tua zawk nai thum sung a mawnate pualaak in, Topa a Pathian bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Levi te atu in dawtuam khat om a, tua ii tungah Jeshua, Bani, Kadmiel, Shebaniah, Bunni, Sherebiah, Bani le Chenani te ding uh hi. Amate in Topa a Pathian tungah a ngingin thungen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nuai a Levi te: Jeshua, Kadmiel, Bani, Hashabneiah, Sherebiah, Hodiah, Shebaniah le Pethahiah te in biak sapna sam uh hi. Amate in: “Ding vun a, Topa na Pathian pok vun; a tawntung a tawntungin ama pok vun! mihing pokna sia a cingtaak zo bua zong, a minthang ama min mi theampo in pok tahen.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel mite in hi bangin thungen uh hi. “ Topa awng, nangma bek Topa na hi a; Vantungte le van a aksite na vawt hi. Lei le tuipi le a sungah, na theampo na piangsak a; nuntakna na pia siat hi. Vantung ah a vaangnei theampote in kun a nang hong bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa Pathian awng, nangma in Abram tealin, Babylon ngam Ur khua pan na paipui a; a min Abraham ci in na kheal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tungah hong thumaanna na mu a, ama taw thuciamna khat na vawt hi. Nangma in Canaan te ngam, Hit te le Amor te ngam, Periz te, Jebus te, Girgash te ngam teng a suan a paalte teenna ngam tu in ama piak tu in kamciam na pia hi. Nangma thumaan na hikom na kamciam na len hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Egypt ah koma ii taanghpupite ii thuakna na mu a; San Tuipi ah hu hong ngetna na za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa, a uliante le a ngammite langpanin nalamdang laknate na vawt hi, banghang ziam cile amate in na mite a zawnsakna na he hi. Tuni dongin na nei minthanna sia tua hunlai pan na nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na mite atu in tuipi kaantanin lampi khat na vawt a, leiko tungah amate na paipui hi. Tuipi kihual sungah suangtum khat a tumsuk bangin, amate a del a ngalte tuithuk sungah tuitaa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sun in amate meei taw lam na pui a, zanin mei taw a lampite na taangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vantung panin Sinai Mual tungah na tuaksuk a; na mite paupui in thukham phate le hilna maante na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na Sabbath nite a thianthosak natu in amate na hil a, na naseampa Moses tungtawnin na thukhamte na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Amate a ngilkial ciang vantung pan anluum na pia a, a dangko ciang suang sung pan tui na pia hi. Amate tungah piak tu in na kamciam sa ngam le lei uk tu in amate na sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahizong koma ii taanghpupite kiphasak in thinpui a, na thupiakte zui tu nial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na thu ni nuam ngawl a; na nasep sate theampo amate in mangil uh hi, na vawtsa nalamdang laknate mangil uh hi. Saltanna Egypt ah a heakpui kik tu in, kiphatsakna taw amate in lampui khat teal uh hi. Ahizong nangma in maw maisak Pathian na hi a; thuthiamna le itna nei in na thin uai hi. Na hesuakna lian a; amate na nusia bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in khuitalno bang milim khat vawtin Egypt pan a paipui pathian hi ci uh hi! Topa awng amate in bangzata nang hong selno ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahizong tualai sennealngam ah amate na nusia bua hi, banghang ziam cile na hesuakna lian hi. Sun le zanin amate lampi a lak tua meei ahibuale tua mei na lakeak bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na phatna taw a sep tu te na son a; manna taw vaakin a neak tu tui na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sennealngam ah kum sawmli tawntung a kisap theampo na sik a; a puante sia ngeingawlin, a peangte nasa in tum ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Minamte le kumpi ngamte, amate taw a kingamngi mun le ngamte na zothalsak hi. Amate in Sihon ukna Heshbon ngam le Og ii kumpi a sepna Bashan ngam te zothal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Van ah aksite za in amate ta tam mama na pia a, a taanghpupite tungah piak tu in na kamciamsa ngam le lei sia na zothalsak a, tuaciang tua ngam ah na teangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in Canaan ngam zothal a; nangma in tualai a teang mite na zo hi. Canaan kumpite le a mite tungah, a uuk bang po a vawt natu in na mite vaangletna na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na mite in kulh taw a ki uum khuapite, ngamphate, nei le lamh taw a kidim innte, a kito sa tuikhukte, olive kungte, thingnga kungte, le sapithuante la uh hi. Amate in a du a dei theampo ne in thau uh hi; amate in na piak naphate theampo taw lungdamin nuamsa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ahizong na mite in nang hong leedo a, na thu hong nial hi; amate in na Thukham nungngat uh hi. Amate in nangma kung hong heak kik natu a son, a kidop thei natu in thu a pia kamsaangte that uh hi. Amate in hun khat zawk hun khat nang hong simmaw uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tua ahikom a ngalte in na zothalsak a, na uksak hi. Ngim nga in, na hu tu dei a nang hong ko uh ciang, vantung panin na zo hi. Na hesuakna lianpi taw lampuite na puak a, amate in a ngalte khut sung pan suatak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kilemna a om kik ciang amate hong khial kik a, a ngalte in amate na zothalsak kik hi. Ahitazong amate kisiik kikin, hut tu hong nget ciang vantung pan na za a, hun khat zawk hun khat na hesuakna lian taw amate na suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na hilnate ni in a kidop natu thu na pia a, ahizong na Thukham zuina in nuntakna lampi hi napi, amate kiphasak a, na thukhamte nial uh hi. Amate a thin sahin a thinpui a, thu ni ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kum khat zawk kum khat amate kidop natu thinsau takin na hil hi. Na kamsaangte thinsung ah a thuson tu na hil a, ahizong na mite in nangonthaak ahikom, minam dangte in amate na zothalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahitazong na hesuakna lian ahikom amate na nusia bup bua a, na lalsak bua hi. Nang sia hesuakna le thuthiamna a nei Pathian na hi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Oh, Pathian, kote Pathian awng, bangzata lian ni ziam! Bangzata kiitakhuai a, bangzata na vaanglian ziam! Na thuciamte thumaan takin na len hi. Assyria kumpite ii kote hong nencip hun pan kipan, tu dong ciang ngawngawn bangzata ngimna thuak khu ziam! Koma ii kumpite, lampuite, thiampite le kamsaangte, taanghpupite le mite theampo in ngimna thuak uh hi. Bangzata ngim nga zo khu ziam hong phawk ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kote daan nong piak sia nong piak tu ma hi a; kote maw kale ung zongh nang na thumaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Koma taanghpupite, kumpite, lampuite le thiampite in na Thukham zui ngawl uh hi. Amate in na thupiakte le a kidop natu thu te ngai ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate na piak ngamzai le kamsaangte, ngampha na ah a teen ciangin, na thupha piakna taw kumpite in na mite uk hi; ahizong amate in a mawna a khialna kisiik ngawlin, na na seam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tu in nong piakna ngam, kote an hong vaak, hi ngampha ah sila ka suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ngamsung pan a piang peuma kumpite kipia a, kote mawnei ka hi uh kom, amate in nong uksak hi. Amate in ko le ka ngannote a uuk bang po in hong vawt uh a, kote ka khuangai mama uh hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hi thupiangte theampo hangin ko Israel mite in ciliap huai takin thukimna lai khat ka vawt uh a, tuaciang koma ii lampuite, Levi te le thiampite in tua lai tungah a tazeik uh tum hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A min a thu masabel sia Hacaliah ii tapa ngamukmang Nehemiah hi a, tua zawkciang Zedekiah in a minthu hi. A nuai a te zongh in a minthu uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Seraiah, Azariah, Jeremiah, Pashhur, Amariah, Malchijah, Hattush, Shebaniah, Malluch, Harim, Meremoth, Obadiah, Daniel, Ginnethon, Baruch, Meshullam, Abijah, Mijamin, Maaziah, Bilgai le Shemaiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azaniah ii tapa Jeshua, Henadad bee le phung Binnui, Kadmiel, Shebaniah, Hodiah, Kelita, Pelaiah, Hanan, Mica, Rehob, Hashabiah, Zaccur, Sherebiah, Shebaniah, Hodiah, Bani, le Beninu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Parosh, Pahath Moab, Elam, Zattu, Bani, Bunni, Azgad, Bebai, Adonijah, Bigvai, Adin, Ater, Hezekiah, Azzur, Hodiah, Hashum, Bezai, Hariph, Anathoth, Nebai Magpiash, Meshullam, Hezir, Meshezabel, Zadok, Jaddua, Pelatiah, Hanan, Anaiah, Hoshea, Hananiah, Hasshub, Hallohesh, Pilha, Shobek, Rehum, Hashabnah, Maaseiah, Ahiah, Hanan, Anan, Malluch, Harim, le Baanah ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ko, Israel mite, thiampite, Levi te, biakinn cingte, biakinn music thiamte, biakinn naseamte le a dangte theampo in Pathian Thukham a zuina in ih ngam sungah a teang ngamdangmite kung pan ka tuam om zawk uh ciang, ka zite le, khua hesa ka tate theampo in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />hong lampuite taw mun khat ah kingawmin, tuasia ka paltan uh le, haamsiatna daan thuak tu in, Pathian ii Moses tungtawn a, a piak Pathian Thukham bang ka nungta tu ci in kiciam khu hi; Topa ii thupiak theampo zui tu le, a thukham le a ngeina theampo zui tu in hi kiciamna ka vawt khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ih ngam sungah a teang ngamdangmite taw ka kiteangthaang buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngamdangmite in Sabbath ni ahibuale a thiangtho ni khat pawpo ah antang le a dang na khat pawpo hong zuak le ka lei buatu uh hi. Kum sali a cin simin lo ka tho buatu uh a, leiba theampo ka bosak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kum simin Biakinnpi sum zaknate ah mi simin ngunntang gram 5 veu ka pia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kote in biakinn biakpiak natu in a nuai a teng a thiangtho anluum, ni sim biakpiakna antang, ni sim biakpiakna ah a kihal tu ngannote, Sabbath te atu in a thiangtho sumpite, Tha Thak Poaite le a dang poaite, a dang a thiangtho biakpiaknate, Israel te mawphel natu biakpiaknate, le Biakinnpi atu a kisamh nadang theampo ka pia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kote, mipite, thiampite, le Levi te in zui tu thukham sungah a om bangin Topa ih Pathian tungah sangaw biakpiaknate a kihal ciang akua bee le phungte in thing si tu ziam a khensat natu in kum simin lai meetang ka sawk tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kote in kum simin ka laak uh anpal le thingnga minciilte, Biakinnpi ah biakpiakna in ka paipui tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Thukham sung a om bangin Biakinnpi sung thiampite kungah ka tapa suakciil tek paipui in, Pathian tungah ka aap tu uh hi. Kote in ka khui, ka tuu ahibuale ka keal khat sim pan a no suakciil teng zongh ka aap tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kote in Biakinnpi sung thiampite kungah kum simin a tungciil antang taw a kivawt anvui muhlom, le biakpiak natu a dang sapittui, olive thau, le thingnga namcin teng ka paipui tu uh hi. Ko lotho khuate ah sawm a khat sumpi a dong Levi te tungah ka leitang tung pan a piang sawm a khat ka pia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Aaron suan thiampite sia sawm a khat sumpi a kikhon ciang Levi te taw kingawm tu a, Levi te khonsa tua sumpi teng sung pan sawm a khat sia Biakinnpi zak tu in biakinn vanh kholna inndoite ah Levi te in paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Israel mite le Levi te in a kipia an, sapittui le olive thaute Biakinnpi vanhzakte kepna vanh kholna inndoite le thiampite nasepna mun, biakinn cingte le biakinn music thiamte omna inndoite ah tua tu uh hi. Eite in ih Pathian innpi ih ngaingon buatu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem ah lampuite teang in, a taanglai mite sung pan innkuan sawm ciang innkuan khat veu, Jerusalem khuapi thiangtho sungah teang tu in lai meetang sawkin teal a, a dang teng sia khuapi le khua dangte ah teangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem ah ama uk thu in a teang nuam dang pawpo mipite in pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A dang khua te le khuapi te sungah Israel mite, thiampite, Levi te, biakinn naseamte le Solomon naseamte ii suan le paalte sia amate khua tek, amate leitang tung tek ah teang uh hi. Judah ngam Jerusalem khua sungah a teang lampuite min tepteena a nuai a bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Uzziah ii tapa le Zechariah ii tupa Athaiah. A taanghpupi dangte sungah Amariah, Shephatiah le Mahalalel kihel a, Judah ii tapa Perez ii suan le paalte veu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baruch ii tapa le Colhozeh ii tupa Maaseiah. A taanghpupi dangte sungah Hazaiah, Adaiah, Joiarib le Zechariah kihel a, Judah ii tapa Shelah ii suan le paalte veu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Perez ii suan le paal sung pan pasal kiciantuam 468 te, Jerusalem ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Meshullam ii tapa, Joed ii tupa ahi Sallu. Ama taanghpupi dangte sungah Pedaiah, Kolaiah, Maaseiah, Ithiel le Jeshaiah kihel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sallu ii mealheak kuungte ahi Gabbai le Sallai. Benjamin mite a vekpi 928 pha in Jerusalem ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zichri ii tapa Joel sia amate lampui hi a, Hassenuah ii tapa Judah sia tua khuapi sungah ulianbel a niina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joiarib ii tapa Jedaiah le Jachin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hilkiah ii tapa, Meshullam ii tupa ahi Seraiah. A taanghpupite sungah Zadok, Meraioth le Thiampi Lianbel Ahitub kihel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi bee le phung sung pan a vekpi 822 pha in Biakinnpi sungah naseam uh hi. Jeroham ii tapa, Pelaliah ii tupa ahi Adaiah. A taanghpupite sungah Amzi, Zechariah, Pashhur le Malchijah kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi bee le phung sung pan a vekpi 242 te sia innkuan lutangte veu hi. Azarel ii tapa, Ahzai ii tupa ahi Amashsai. A taanghpupite sungah Meshillemoth le Immer kihel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi bee le phung sung pan ngalkap mindok tuam 128 om hi. Amate lampui sia Zabdiel hi a, bangkua kician sung pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hasshub ii tapa, Azrikam ii tupa ahi Shemaiah. A taanghpupite sungah Hashabiah le Bunni kihel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levipa Shabbethai le Jozabad sia Biakinnpi puasang nasep uk a kiciante ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asaph suan, Mica ii tapa, Zabdi ii tupa ahi Mattaniah. Ama in lungdamko thungetna ah biakinn lasa pawlte lampui hi. Mattaniah nasep a huu pa Bakbukiah. Jeduthun suan, Shammua ii tapa, Galal ii tupa ahi Abda.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Levite a vekpi in 284 pha a, Jerusalem khuapi thiangtho sungah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Akkub, Talmon le a mealheakte a vekpi in 172 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A taanglai Israel mite le a om lai thiampite le Levi te sia Judah khuate le a dang khuapi te ah amate ii neisa leitang tungah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ophel a kicina mun Jerusalem ah biakinn naseamte teang in, Ziha le Gishpa khutnuai ah naseam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uzzi sia Jerusalem a teang Levi te nasep a ukpa hi a, Bani ii tapa, Hashabiah ii tupa ahi hi. A taanghpupite sungah Mattaniah le Mica kihel a, ama sia biakinn biak kikhopna ah music vaipuak a nei Asaph bee le phung pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bee le phung tuatuamte kilaih in ni simin biakinn music lampuina ah a sep zia taw kisai in a zui tu kumpi ngeinate om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah nam, Zerah bee le phung. Meshezabel ii tapa Pethahiah in Persia te ii thukhenzum ah Israel mite taang in ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihing tam mama sia a lo thawna paam khuate ah teang uh hi. Judah namte sia Kiriath Arba, Dibon le Jekabzeel le hi khuapite ii nai khuanote ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate Jeshua, Moladah, Bethpelet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />le Hazarshual khuapi te tuaciang Beersheba khuapi le a kiim a om khuanote zongh ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate sia Ziklag khuapi, Meconah le a khuanote sungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Enrimmon, Zorah, Jarmuth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zanoah, Adullam khua te sung le hi khua te ii a kiim a paam khuanote ah teang uh hi. Amate Lachish le a naina lote sungah le Azekah khua le a khuanote ah teang uh hi. Judah mite teenna ngam sia thangsang ah Beersheba le saksangah Hinnom Kuam kilaklaw teng kici thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin nam pan mite Geba, Michmash, Ai, Bethel le a nai na khuano te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anathoth, Nob, Ananiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor, Ramah, Gittaim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hadid, Zeboim, Neballat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lod le Ono le Khutthiamte Kual sungah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Judah ngamsung a teang Levi mi pawlkhatte sia Benjamin mite taw teang khawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shealtiel ii tapa Zerubbabel le Thiampi Lianbel Joshua taw saltanna pan a cia kik, thiampite le Levi te min tepteena a nuai a bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Seraiah, Jeremiah, Ezra, Amariah, Malluch, Hattush, Shecaniah, Rehum, Meremoth, Iddo, Ginnethoi, Abijah, Mijamin, Maadiah, Bilgah, Shemaiah, Joiarib, Jedaiah, Sallu, Amok, Hilkiah le Jedaiah ahi uh hi. Hite sia Joshua hunlai in a thiampipuite theampo sungah lampuite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nuai a teng sia lungdamko biakna lasakna ah lampuite veu hi: Jeshua, Binnui, Kadmiel, Sherebiah, Judah le Mattaniah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kizo choir lasate a nuai a bang hi: Bakbukiah, Unno le a Levi puite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joshua sia Joiakim ii pa hi a; Joiakim sia Eliashib ii pa hi; Eliashib sia Joiada ii pa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joiada sia Jonathan ii pa hi a; Jonathan sia Jaddua ii pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joiakim ii Thiampi Lianbel a sep lai in thiampi bee lutangte sia a nuai a thiampite veu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thiampi Lianbel te: Eliashib, Joiada, Jonathan le Jaddua te nuntak hun sungin Levi innkuan lutangte le thiampi innkuan lutangte tepteena khat kikoi hi. Hi tepteena sia Darius ii Persia kumpilianpa a sep lai in kizo siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Levi innkuan lutangte tepteena lai ahile Eliashib ii tupa Jonathan hun dong bekma zumlai tepteena sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hashabiah, Sherebiah, Jeshua, Binnui le Kadmiel te sawlna taw Levi te a pawl a pawl veu sua hi. Pathian mi David kumpipa thupiakna taw kizui in, pawl nii veu in kilaih in Pathian pok a, lungdamko uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Biakinnpi kongpite hui ah vanh kholna inndoi a cingte a uk biakinn cingte sia a nuai a teng hi: Mattaniah, Bakbukiah, Obadiah, Meshullam, Talmon le Akkub.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi mite sia Joshua ii tapa, Jehozadak ii tupa ahi Joiakim hun, le ngamukmang Nehemiah le Thukham a he, thiampi mipil Ezra te hun lai in a omte veu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem khuapi luphung a ki aap ciang, daakbute le tengtonghte tumin lungdamkona late taw a ki aapna poai ah a kihel thei natu in Levi te sia a teenna tek pan kikaikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Levi innkuan la sate sia Jerusalem khua kiim a teenna tek pan le Netophah kiim khuate pan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tuaciang Bethgilgal, Geba le Azmaveth panin kikhawmtua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thiampite le Levi te in amate, mipite, kongpite le khuapi luphung atu in a zeksa thiansuana seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Luphung tungah Judah lampuite ka khawmtua a, Pathian tungah lungdamko in, khuapi a kiimkot tu pawl lian niite ka uksak hi. A masa pawl sia luphung tung ziatsang Ninthuk Kongpi sang manaw in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />La sate nung pan Hoshaiah pai a, Judah lampuite a lang in zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A zom kik a nuai a thiampi teng in lemle tumin pai uh hi: Azariah, Ezra, Meshullam, Judah, Benjamin, Shemaiah le Jeremiah. Tua zawkciang Jonathan ii tapa Shemaiah ii tupa ahi, Zechariah in zui hi. (A taanghpupite sungah Asaph bee le phungte ahi Mattaniah, Micaiah le Zaccur te zongh kihel hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zechariah sia a bee le phung sung pan a dangte — Shemaiah, Azarel, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Nethanel, Judah le Hanani — a vekpi in Pathian mi David kumpipa ii a tum thei music vanh namte keng uh hi. Hi pawl sia a pai ciang laithiam mipil Ezra in lampui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuinaak Kongpi pan David Khuapi sangah kaato in, David kumpi inn kaantan a, khuapi nisuana sang Tui Kongpi luphung ah heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lungdam a ko pawldang khat sia luphung tung a veisang tawnin pai a, keima le mipite a lang in ka zui uh hi. Meikhukte Tausaang kaantan in Luphung Zai sia ah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tua mun pan Ephraim Kongpi, Jeshanah Kongpi, Ngasa Kongpi, Hananel Tausaang le Zakhat Tausaang te kaantan in Tuu Kongpi ah ka pai uh a, Biakinnpi kongpi hui ah ka tawp uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuabangin Pathian tung lungdam a ko tua pawl niite biakinn suumsung theng uh hi. Keima taw a omkhawm lampuite ban ah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />ka pawl sungah lemle tum a nuai a thiampite: Eliakim, Maaseiah, Miniamin, Micaiah, Elioenai, Zechariah le Hananiah te kihel a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />tuaciang amate nung pan Maaseiah, Shemaiah, Eleazar, Uzzi, Jehohanan, Malchijah, Elam le Ezer te in zui uh hi. Jezrahiah ii lampui lasate in a aw neiza taw lasa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ni in sangaw biakpiakna tam mama kipia a, mipite lungdamna taw kidim uh hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian in amate lungdamsak mama hi. Numeite le patangte tua poai ah kihel in, amate ii awngingte a khualana pan kiza kawkoai thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua hunlai in sawm a khat sumpite, kum sim anpalte le a minciil thingngate a kihel Biakinnpi atu a kipiate kikepna vanh kholna inndoite a uk tu in pasalte kikoi hi. Hi mite in Thukham sungah a om bangin khuapi tuatuam naina ah a om lote pan thiampite le Levi te atu a kipiate, kaikhop tu vaipuak nei uh hi. Judah mi theampo thiampite le Levi te tungah lungkim uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />banghang ziam cile amate in Pathian thupiakna bangin kithiansuana poaite le a zeksa dangte vawtsak hi. David kumpipa le a tapa Solomon ii zui tu ngeina a piakte bangin biakinn music thiamte le biakinn cingte zongh in pha takin a sep tute seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nidang lai, David kumpipa le music thiam Asaph hun pan kipan lasate in Pathian pokna late le lungdamkona lasaknate lampui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Zerubbabel le Nehemiah hun ciang zonghin biakinn music thiamte le biakinn cingte kivaak natu in Israel mi theampo in ni simin letsong pia uh hi. Mipite in Levi te tungah a thiangtho biakpiaknate pia a, Levi te in a kisamh za thiampite pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mipite tungah nging takin Moses ii Thukham a kisim ciang Ammon te le Moab te sia Pathian mite sungah kihel thei ngawl tu hi a cina laingual mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuasia banghang ziam cile Israel mite Egypt pan a pusua lai in, lampi ah Ammon le Moab mite in an le tui a piak ngawl hang hi. Amate in Israel a haamsiat tu in Balaam sum pia ahihang ih Pathian in tua haamsiatna sia thupha khat suaksak zaw pum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite in hi thukham a kisim a zaak ciang amate mi sungah ngamdangmi theampo kihelsak ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biakinn vanh kholna inndoite a uk thiampi Eliashib sia Tobiah taw khuangei hialma a thu kisi in om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Tobiah sia antang le ngimnamtui biakpiaknate, Biakinnpi sungah a kizangh vanhte, thiampite atu biakpiaknate le, tuaciang Levi te, biakinn music thiamte le biakinn cingte a kipia antang, sapittui le olive thau, sawm a khat te bek khol natu a, a kingaisun inndoi lian sia zong zanghsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi bang teng ahi hunlai in Jerusalem ah ka om bua hi, banghang ziam cile Artaxerxes ii Babylon kumpi a sep zawk kum 32 kum in, ama kungah thupuak tu in ka pai kik hi. Hun tawmvei zawkciang ama oaina taw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem ah ka heak kik hi. Tualai ah Eliashib in Biakinnpi inndoi khat Tobiah a zaksak ka mu ciang ka patau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thinso a, Tobiah neisa vanh theampo ka lotkeaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua inndoite a zeksa om bangin a kithianthosak natu le biakinn vanhte, biakpiakna ante le ngimnamtuite a kikoi kik natu in thu ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipite in a khamkhop tu an pia zo ngawl ahikom biakinn music thiamte le a dang Levi te in Jerusalem nusia in a lo tek a zot kik zongh ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biakinnpi a kingaingonsak hu in tua uliante ka teih zazaan hi. Tuaciang Levi te le music thiamte Biakinnpi ah ka kaikhawm kik a, a nasep ka seamsak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel mite theampo in biakinn vanh kholna inndoite ah sawm a khat a piak antang, sapittui le olive thaute a puak kipan kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vanh kholna inndoite uk tu in, a nuai a teng: thiampi Shelemiah; thukham a he mipil Zadok; le Levi mi Pedaiah ka koi hi. Mattaniah ii tupa, Zaccur ii tapa ahi Hanan in amate hu tu hi. Hi mite in a naseppuite tungah thumaanna taw an hawm tu in a muanhuai mite ahi sia ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka Pathian awng, na Biakinnpi atu le a biakpiak natu in hi ka nasepnate theampo hong phawsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua hunlai Judah ngam ah mite in Sabbath ni in sapittui a suuk uh ka mu hi. Midangte in an, sapittui, sapitngate, thei ngate le, nadang teng a laate tungah suanhin Jerusalem ah a tumpui ka mu a; Sabbath ni in bangma a zuak ngawl natu in a kidop natu thu ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tyre khuapi mite pawlkhat Jerusalem ah teang a, tuate in Sabbath ni in ka mite tungah a zuak tu ngasate le vanh tuatuamte khuapi sungah hong paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jew lampuite ka teih a, amate tungah, “A sia na vawt uhte en ve vun! Sabbath ni ninsak nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi bang linlian in na taanghpupite ngamta ahikom Pathian in daan pia a, hi khuapi lalcipsak hi. Tua hi napi Sabbath ni nitsakna taw Israel tungah Pathian thin uuk seseam natu in vawt veve nu hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom Sabbath a kipat sim, nitak kipat po ciang khuapi kongpite a kikha natu le Sabbath hun a bo mateng a kihon kik ngawl natu in thu ka pia hi. Sabbath ni in khuapi sungah bangma a kitumpui ngawl het natu in ka mihingte pawlkhat in kongpite ka cingsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vanh namcin a zuakte khatvei niivei khawng khuapi luphung pua sangah nipi zawk Ni nga ni zanin ngiak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua mite tungah, “Zingsang ciang dong na ngak uh hang a kimanna om bo. Hi bang na om kik uh le, zawthawk thu kong zak kul tu hi,” ci in a kidop natu in thu ka pia hi. Tua hun a kipan Sabbath ni in amate hong pai kik ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Levi te amate le amate kithiansua natu le Sabbath a thianthosak nanak natu in, kongpite pha tak a cin natu thu ka pia hi. Pathian awng, hi thu zongh ah hong phawk ta'n a, itna lian nei na hikom kei hong suaktasak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hun in Judah pasal tam mama in Ashdod, Ammon le Moab numeite a teenpui uh zongh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tate a lang in Ashdod kam ahibuale kamdang khat pau in om a, amate in koma kam pau thei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua pasalte teih in ka haamsiat ngawp a, saatin, a sam ka nuk zazaan hi. Tua zawkciang amate ahizong a tate ahizong ngamdangmite taw a ten kik ngei nawn ngawl natu in Pathian min taw ka kiciamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keima in, “Solomon kumpipa a mawsak a khialsak sia ngamdang numeite hi. Ama in minam dangte ii kumpite sangin a lianzaw pa hi. Pathian in ama it a, Israel theampo ii kumpi suaksak napi, hi mawna khialna sungah puk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kote in na ngamtatna hong zui in ngamdang numeite teenpuina taw ih Pathian thu nial tu khu ziam?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Joiada sia Thiampi Lianbel Eliashib ii tapa hi a, ahizong Joiada ii tapate khat in Beth Horon khua pan Sanballat ii tanu teenpui ahikom Jerusalem pan Joiada ka hawlkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian awng, hi mite in thiampi nasepna mun le thiampite le Levi te taw na vawt thuciamna te a nitsakna thu phawk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ngamdang taw a kipee-awna theampo pan mipite ka thiansua a, amate nasep tu tek a heak natu in thiampite le Levi te zui tu ngeinate ka vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A hun ciang biakpiaknate halna ah a kizangh thingte a kipaipui natu le mipite ii a anpalte le thingnga minciilte taw biakpiaknate a paipui natu in ka vaihawmsak hi. Pathian awng, hite theampo phawk in a, tuaciang keima hong kiphaw natu hong hisak ta'n.
  </para>
</usx>
